  Learn to buff up your pet a lot before entering the Mines.  The
wielded weapons mess up pets' risk calculations.  Get two large
dogs/cats and they'll just chew up the Gnomish Mines.  You can explore
while they play with their food.

  See this post for more on playing early Healers:

<http://groups.google.com/group/rec.games.roguelike.nethack/msg/b2f705f44328c6d4?hl=en&>

  Healers start with poison resistance.  That means they can #untrap
dart traps without risking poison instadeath.  Still be careful of Hp
damage.  Use the darts as early ranged weapon before getting a dagger
stack to throw.  #enhance dagger but not darts.  (9 out of 10 uncursed
+0 darts will disappear after hitting twice.)

